[0.386454, "o", "╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\r\n║       Claude Code Go SDK - Retry & Error Handling Demo     ║\r\r\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\r\n\r\r\nThis demo showcases retry and error handling features:\r\r\n  • Configurable retry policies with exponential backoff\r\r\n  • Jitter to prevent thundering herd\r\r\n  • Error classification (retryable vs non-retryable)\r\r\n  • Context timeout support\r\r\n  • Enhanced mode with automatic retry\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nð Retry Commands:\r\r\n  /retries <n>     - Set max retry attempts (0-10)\r\r\n  /delay <ms>      - Set base delay in milliseconds\r\r\n  /maxdelay <ms>   - Set max delay in milliseconds\r\r\n  /backoff <n>     - Set backoff factor (e.g., 2.0)\r\r\n  /timeout <sec>   - Set request t"]
[0.38647, "o", "imeout in seconds (0="]
[0.386507, "o", "none)\r\r\n  /enhanced on|off - Toggle enhanced mode (auto-retry)\r\r\n  /default         - Reset to default retry policy\r\r\n  /aggressive      - Use aggressive retry (more retries, shorter delays)\r\r\n  /conservative    - Use conservative retry (fewer retries, longer delays)\r\r\n  /status          - Show current retry configuration\r\r\n  /help            - Show this help\r\r\n  exit             - Exit the demo\r\r\n\r\r\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\r\n│ Max Retries: 3   | Base Delay: 100ms    | Max Delay: 5s      │\r\r\n│ Backoff Factor: 2.0  | Timeout: none       | Enhanced: false │\r\r\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\r\n\r\r\n>>> "]
